00:02:17.710 --> 00:02:32.280
<v Ira Glass>From WBEZ Chicago, it's This American Life . I'm Ira Glass. Today on our program, Sissies. Weak ones, defiant ones, brave ones, and the ones who do not even know they are a sissy. Act One, Anti-Oedipus.
