00:06:57.340 --> 00:07:19.630
<v Nancy Updike>Margie's from Georgia and lived most of her married life either up north or in the Middle East. Mubarak's father, Sabir, is Palestinian, born in Jordan. But for most of the marriage, they all lived in a small town in Pennsylvania where he was a professor of civil engineering. Now if Mubarak was a sissy in white, working-class, Catholic Hershey, PA, Sabir was too.
<v Nancy Updike>玛姬来自佐治亚州，大部分婚后生活要么在北方，要么在中东。穆巴拉克的父亲萨比尔是巴勒斯坦人，出生于约旦。但在大部分婚姻生活中，他们都住在宾夕法尼亚州的一个小镇，他是一名土木工程教授。如果说穆巴拉克在白人、工人阶级、天主教区的宾州赫尔希是个娘娘腔，那萨比尔也一样。

00:07:19.630 --> 00:07:49.470
